    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Here at Byrne Malone we love unique homes and we are delighted to present this stunning residence at Robertstown to the market by private Treaty. \n\nWelcome to this breath-taking detached family home, set on circa 3 acres of picturesque land with unrivalled views. Step inside to a grand, tiled hallway leading to a beautifully designed sitting room and an impressive open-plan kitchen, dining, and living space. This stunning area boasts vaulted ceilings, timber beams, and a stove burner, perfect for creating a warm and inviting atmosphere on cosy nights. The tiled flooring throughout adds elegance, while the spacious utility room provides ample storage for effortless organization.\n\nThis home also offers a dedicated office space, a convenient downstairs WC, and 5 generously sized bedrooms, three of which feature en-suite bathrooms. Upstairs, a converted attic bedroom and a large storage area add even more versatility to this incredible property that could easily make 2 or 3 more bedrooms or office space.\n\nOutside, this exceptional property continues to impress with manicured gardens and a spacious patio, perfect for outdoor entertaining and soaking in the breathtaking surroundings. A large timber shed and aluminium workshop/storage space provide practical solutions for organization and storage needs. The gated entrance ensures security and privacy, creating a secluded retreat for peaceful living.\n\nThis home seamlessly blends luxury, functionality, and tranquillity, making it an ideal haven. \n\nA perfect blend of charm, space, and modern conveniences?this exceptional home is ready to welcome its new owners.\n\nSituated in a quiet rural area close to Robertstown Village and 4 minutes drive to Prosperous village, 10 minutes to Clane twenty minute drive to Naas and a ten minute drive to Caragh Village. The M7 is twenty minutes away and the M4 is just thirty minutes away. VIEWING IS A MUST."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning Detached Family Home\n3 Acres of Private Gardens\nHigh-quality finishes throughout the property\n5 Bedrooms and 5 bathrooms\nEasy Access to Newbridge and Sallins Train Stations\nEasy M7 Access J10 \nAmple parking\nBeautiful manicured garden\n\n"
      },
